:</strong> Race against yourself to achieve the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 4 players in local split-screen for more excitement and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Circuit Race:</strong> Compete against players, AI opponents, or a combination of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sprint Race:</strong> Race against players, AI, or a combination of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cops and Robbers Mode:</strong> One player takes on the role of the cop while the other plays as the robber in exciting chases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Mode:</strong> Engage in vehicular combat and be the last car standing with a unique jump-to-win mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cruise: </strong>free roam with friends with no specific objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["agrandht"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522180/header.jpg?t=1749003375","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131937,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131937/movie480.mp4?t=1747927753","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131937/movie_max.mp4?t=1747927753"},"name":"Daily Driven Racer Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131937/e1be744cf84c6809887744d48e36927c1aca9697/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747927753","webm":{"480":"http://vide