nd hardcore players. Play with 2-4 players in local split-screen for maximum fun!","steam_appid":3522180,"support_info":{"email":"agrandht@gmail.com","url":"https://sites.google.com/view/agrandht/contact"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://sites.google.com/view/agrandht/home"}